1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:01,263
You're an African buffalo,

2
00:00:01,283 --> 00:00:02,520
and it's election day.

3
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:03,495
Your herd rests in

4
00:00:03,515 --> 00:00:04,712
the afternoon heat.

5
00:00:04,732 --> 00:00:05,650
Then one female

6
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:06,362
stands up,

7
00:00:06,382 --> 00:00:07,787
stares in one direction,

8
00:00:07,807 --> 00:00:09,050
and lies back down.

9
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:09,922
That's her vote.

10
00:00:09,942 --> 00:00:11,184
Other adult females

11
00:00:11,204 --> 00:00:12,122
do the same.

12
00:00:12,142 --> 00:00:13,510
Only the adult females

13
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:14,270
get to vote.

14
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:15,158
Then the whole herd

15
00:00:15,178 --> 00:00:16,008
gets up and heads

16
00:00:16,028 --> 00:00:17,170
where the votes point,

17
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:18,045
toward that night's

18
00:00:18,065 --> 00:00:19,102
grazing spot.

19
00:00:19,122 --> 00:00:21,535
Democracy, buffalo style.
